<title>USA: Nissan May US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Nissan May US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>			May 1-31, 1997     May 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    25,398	    23,354	     +8.8</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  13,232	    12,444	     +6.3</p>
<p> Import Car		15,329	    16,476	     -7.0</p>
<p> Import Truck	     8,548	     5,713	    +49.6</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-May 31, 1997 Jan 1-May 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   124,262	   130,274	     -3.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  75,604	    63,329	    +20.3</p>
<p> Import Car		86,232	    81,161	     +7.1</p>
<p> Import Truck	    36,957	    23,695	    +57.2</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, 128 for year to date vs 129 in year ago.</p>
</text>
